---
// Compact Founder Credibility & Commitment Section
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-16 sm:py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#08090e] via-[#0c0f16] to-[#06060a] border-t border-white/[0.08]">
  <!-- Atmospheric glow and subtle grid pattern -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_75%_55%_at_50%_35%,rgba(16,185,129,0.06),transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="page-shell relative z-10">
    <!-- Centered Compact Feature Card -->
    <div class="reveal-on-scroll relative mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#11131a]/95 via-[#0c0d12]/95 to-[#08090c]/95 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-xl text-center overflow-hidden">
      
      <!-- Subtle Decorative Quotation Mark -->
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-3 left-6 sm:left-8 select-none font-serif text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-bold leading-none text-emerald-400/10" aria-hidden="true">
        &ldquo;
      </div>

      <!-- Credibility Hook as Section Eyebrow -->
      <div class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-300 mb-5 shadow-sm">
        <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-emerald-500"></span>
        </span>
        <span>Why I'm Personally Onboarding the First 10 Stores</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Centerpiece Quote -->
      <blockquote class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl">
        <p class="font-heading text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold leading-snug text-[#fcfdff] tracking-tight">
          &ldquo;Boutique founders shouldn't have to stay awake until 2 AM manually replying to &lsquo;Price?&rsquo; comments and texting bank details. Our standard is simple: <span class="text-emerald-400">VoluChat must deliver at least 10x the value of what you pay</span>, or we haven't earned your business.&rdquo;
        </p>
      </blockquote>

      <!-- Supporting Founder Note -->
      <p class="relative z-10 mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed text-[rgba(252,253,255,0.7)]">
        For our 10 pilot fashion stores, I am personally managing the entire setup — syncing catalog inventory &amp; size charts, configuring Meta Cloud APIs, and tuning the AI stylist on your brand voice until your DM conversions visibly double.
      </p>

      <!-- Founder Visual Anchor & Headshot Card -->
      <div class="relative z-10 mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-white/[0.08] flex items-center justify-center gap-3.5">
        <!-- Styled Founder Avatar with Active Indicator -->
        <div class="relative shrink-0">
          <div class="grid h-10 w-10 sm:h-11 sm:w-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1b1f2b] via-[#12151f] to-[#0a0c12] border border-emerald-400/40 text-emerald-300 font-heading font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/10">
            VG
          </div>
          <span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 ring-2 ring-[#0c0d12]"></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Name & Credibility Details -->
        <div class="text-left">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h4 class="font-heading text-sm font-bold text-white">Vaibhav Goyal</h4>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 px-1.5 py-0.2 text-[9px] font-mono font-medium text-emerald-400">
              Founder &amp; Engineer
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-normal">
            VoluChat &bull; QubitNine Technologies Pvt Ltd
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
